      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Spokane Falls and Northern Railway arrived in 1889, and remnants of that era linger in downtown historic buildings and the Walt Goodman Historical Museum.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
